A decision has resolved. Extract what is worth remembering about this user.

Six modules will each recall from their own store, and each one cares about a
different kind of thing. Extract for whichever of them applies — not everything is
worth remembering, and an empty list for a module is a perfectly good answer.

<question>
{{ card.question }}
</question>

WHAT THE COUNCIL RECOMMENDED
